  "title": "Bacalhau Portuguese ao Forno (Salt Cod with Tomatoes and Olives)",
  "description": "Salt cod layered with potatoes and tomatoes is baked until flaky in this hearty, one-dish Portuguese dinner topped with olives and parsley.",
  "authors": [
    "Vólola"
  ],
